</ul>
<p>Opt-in or opt-out from these services is done centrally through us and will be explained in detail in the course of the process.</p>
<h3>Server logs</h3>
<p>All requests to our website are logged by the hosting provider (server logs); this is necessary to ensure the smooth operation of the site.</p>
<p>The following data is stored for 3 months:</p>
<ul>
